  "body": "Hello,\r\nin homeserver.yaml you can change the setting for user_directory to search all users on the server.\r\n\r\nWhen activating this you will see **all the users** who have any \"connection\" to this server.\r\nOne can activate the setting to prefer local users.\r\n\r\nBut it would be nice to activate the search for local users only.\r\n\r\nOn an private server the users would find each other but not all the others with whom someone communicates too.\r\nThank you very much.",
